WEBVTT

00:00.700 --> 00:03.102
Every code review starts the same way.

00:03.500 --> 00:04.577
You read the code.

00:04.617 --> 00:06.914
Then you type every single thought.

00:07.000 --> 00:09.179
You speak three times faster than you

00:09.219 --> 00:12.005
type. But speech has no line numbers.

00:12.500 --> 00:13.602
This is Murmur.

00:13.900 --> 00:15.916
Review pull requests by talking.

00:15.956 --> 00:18.774
Powered by your voice, and Wispr Flow.

00:21.800 --> 00:23.732
Paste any public pull request.

00:23.772 --> 00:25.538
Murmur pulls the real diff.

00:25.578 --> 00:26.707
No sign-in.

00:27.700 --> 00:28.781
Now just talk.

00:28.821 --> 00:31.628
Hold your Wispr Flow hotkey, and ramble.

00:31.668 --> 00:34.968
Release, and Flow types it into the box.

00:35.200 --> 00:36.030
Name a file.

00:36.070 --> 00:37.400
Say what worries you.

00:37.440 --> 00:39.512
It doesn't have to be neat.

00:40.100 --> 00:42.549
One click. Murmur reads the diff, and pins

00:42.589 --> 00:44.638
each thought to a real line.

00:47.600 --> 00:49.487
Severity. The exact line.

00:49.527 --> 00:53.181
And your own sentence, attached as the receipt.

00:57.500 --> 01:00.573
Click what you said, and it jumps to the comment.

01:03.000 --> 01:05.671
Then copy it as markdown, or post it as a

01:05.711 --> 01:07.387
real GitHub review.

01:10.900 --> 01:12.939
Four things make Murmur different.

01:14.000 --> 01:16.859
One. Every comment carries your own words.

01:16.899 --> 01:19.241
Your sentence is the receipt.

01:20.700 --> 01:22.554
Two. It can't invent a line.

01:22.594 --> 01:24.895
Every anchor is checked against the real

01:24.935 --> 01:27.880
diff, and failures are shown as unpinned.

01:28.500 --> 01:30.788
Three. It says only what you said.

01:30.828 --> 01:32.720
No opinions of its own.

01:34.400 --> 01:36.071
Four. It just works.

01:36.111 --> 01:38.889
Live, no sign-in, nothing stored.

01:39.600 --> 01:40.911
And the details.

01:40.951 --> 01:43.283
Severity levels, suggested code,

01:43.323 --> 01:46.638
shortcuts, a phone layout, and tests.

01:51.000 --> 01:52.060
Murmur. Say it.

01:52.100 --> 01:53.425
Ship the review.

01:54.100 --> 01:56.580
Live now. Open it, and talk.
